    "investigationPath": "Start with high-risk successful sign-ins in SigninLogs, then pivot on the same user and IP into CloudAppEvents to confirm suspicious OAuth consent and file download activity. DeviceNetworkEvents shows the same IP was contacted from FIN-LAP-014 by the affected user, tying the browser activity back to the endpoint.",
